</section>

<!-- 03 -->
<section class="hx-option" id="hx-3">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hx-cap"><p>03 · Editorial</p><p><b>Editorial, oversized</b>The headline as the image: set huge, edge to edge, on two lines. Everything else waits under one hairline in a quiet four-column row: the lede, the social proof as a number, and the actions. Closest to the site's current editorial grid, with far less on screen.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="hx-stage hx-3">
    <div class="container hx-in">
      <div class="hx-3-top"><span>Sage · Technical Capital</span><span>Est. before ChatGPT</span></div>
      <h2 class="hx-title"><span>Your next</span><span class="text-accent">AI breakthrough</span></h2>
      <div class="hx-3-row">
        <p class="hx-lede">Decades of experience building AI before ChatGPT. We create custom solutions and open-source tools to grow your business.</p>
        <div class="hx-3-stat"><b>100s</b><span>of students already build with Sage</span></div>
        <div class="hx-actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://sage.is/programs#packages">Start a project {{ arrow | safe }}</a>
          <a class="hx-link" href="https://github.com/Sage-is/AI-UI" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ github | safe }} AI-UI v3.2.0</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 04 -->
<section class="hx-option" id="hx-4">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hx-cap"><p>04 · Brand</p><p><b>Wordmark ground</b>The brand becomes the floor: SAGE.IS in Anton, as wide as the screen, rising letter by letter and fading into the glow at the bottom edge. The headline and actions sit small above it. Bold, but with almost nothing on screen.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="hx-stage hx-4">
    <span class="hx-glow"></span>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hx-4-body hx-in">
        <h2 class="hx-title">Your next <span class="text-accent">AI breakthrough</span></h2>
        <div class="hx-4-side">
          <p class="hx-lede">Decades of experience building AI before ChatGPT. We create custom solutions and open-source tools to grow your business.</p>
          <div class="hx-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="https://sage.is/programs#packages">Start a project {{ arrow | safe }}</a>
            <a class="hx-link" href="https://github.com/Sage-is/AI-UI" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ github | safe }} GitHub</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hx-4-mark" aria-hidden="true">{% for ch in "SAGE.IS" | list %}<span{% if ch == "." %} class="dot"{% endif %}>{{ ch }}</span>{% endfor %}</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 05 -->
<section class="hx-option" id="hx-5">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hx-cap"><p>05 · Clarity</p><p><b>Three doors</b>The headline, then the three things Sage offers as three doors along the bottom, each with one line on what it is. Replaces the row of three equal buttons with a choice a visitor can actually read; the top edge of a door lights as you point at it.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="hx-stage hx-5">
    <span class="hx-glow"></span>
    <div class="container hx-in">
      <div class="hx-5-head">
        <span class="hx-label">Hundreds of students already build with Sage</span>
        <h2 class="hx-title">Your next <span class="text-accent">AI breakthrough</span></h2>
        <p class="hx-lede">Decades of experience building AI before ChatGPT. We create custom solutions and open-source tools to grow your business.</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="hx-5-doors">
        {% for p in products %}
        <li><a class="hx-door" href="{{ p.href }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <span class="hx-door-top"><span class="hx-label">{{ p.tag }}</span>{{ arrow | safe }}</span>
          <h3>{% if loop.first %}{{ github | safe }}{% endif %}{{ p.name }}</h3>
          <p>{{ p.desc }}</p>
          <small>{{ p.meta }}</small>
        </a></li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
(function () {
  var still = matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;

  // Entrances: each hero plays once, when a third of it is on screen
  var io = new IntersectionObserver(function (entries) {
    entries.forEach(function (e) {
      if (!e.isIntersecting) return;
      e.target.classList.add('is-on');
      e.target.querySelectorAll('.hx-in').forEach(function (el) { el.classList.add('is-on'); });
      if (e.target.querySelector('[data-hx-chat]')) chat(e.target.querySelector('[data-hx-chat]'));
      io.unobserve(e.target);
    });
  }, { threshold: 0.33 });
  document.querySelectorAll('.hx-stage').forEach(function (el) { io.observe(el); });

  // 02: the conversation arrives one message at a time
  function chat(win) {
    win.querySelectorAll('.hx-msg').forEach(function (m, i) {
      setTimeout(function () { m.classList.add('is-on'); }, still ? 0 : 500 + i * 1100);
    });
  }
})();
</script>
